Dark Pharaoh is a [[Blood Spiral Brotherhood]] Titan that was in the possession of Rassimov. {{Source|The Golden Asp}}

Rassimov later gave Dark Pharaoh to one of his [[Unnamed Suit 040|Suits]]. The Suit invoked the Titan in an ambush to the Huntik Team in the midst of a sandstorm. [[Dante Vale]] invoked [[Solwing]] in response, making Dark Pharaoh shoot one of its spheres toward Dante's Titan, but missed. Shortly after, Dark Pharaoh shot at a turned-away [[Caliban]], and incapacitated the Titan for a short period of time. Dante cast [[Touchram]] at the dark Titan and sent it back to its amulet. {{Source|The Golden Asp}}

The same Suit invoked Dark Pharaoh to participate in the large battle in [[King Solomon's Mines]]. Dark Pharaoh fought [[Feyone]] but was unable to hurt [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]]'s Titan, being sent back to its amulet shortly after by [[Tao]], at the command of [[Lok Lambert|Lok]].{{Source|To Be Together}}

A Dark Pharaoh Titan was in the possession of [[Omeed]], an [[Organization]] operative. {{Source|TCG:LGS-044|LGS-044}}

A [[Casterwill Hunter]] invoked a Dark Pharaoh Titan to attack [[Caliban|Powerbonded Caliban]] and [[Ironsquire]]. Ultimately, Dark Pharaoh and Ironsquire defeated each other. {{Source|The Casterwill Connection}}

A Casterwill Hunter invoked Dark Pharaoh to attack [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Kipperin|Powerbonded Kipperin]]. Dark Pharaoh then fought [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|The Dead Magic Island}}
